[SIZE=5][B]Important note[/B][/SIZE]
The dialog menu shown in the pictures needs Minecraft 1.21.6 or newer. Players or servers below that get the same menu as a chest, automatically.

Every screenshot on this page is from a real Minecraft client on a Paper test server running Linear. Every number comes from the benchmark described in section 09.
